<title>SWITZERLAND: ABB DETAILS H1 ORDERS PER SEGMENT.</title>
<headline>ABB DETAILS H1 ORDERS PER SEGMENT.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997:</p>
<p>				     (million dollars unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net orders	  20,049		 vs 17,634</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p> Power generation	  5,643		  vs 4,959</p>
<p>Power transmission and</p>
<p>  distribution	     5,608		  vs 4,331</p>
<p>Industrial and</p>
<p>  building systems	 8,638		  vs 8,568</p>
<p> Adtranz -Transportation  1,064		  vs 1,006</p>
<p> Financial Services	344		    vs 223</p>
<p> Various Activities	1,661		  vs 1,745</p>
<p> Intra-group transaction 2,909		  vs 3,198</p>
<p> Group total orders	22,958		 vs 20,832</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is ABB Asea Brown Boveri AG</p>
<p>-- Peter Nielsen, Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
